inistration of any food product known to alter P450 enzyme or P-gp activity such as grapefruit juice, Seville oranges\"\n                                                                    },\n                                                                    \"right\": {\n                                                                      \"OR\": {\n                                                                        \"left\": {\n                                                                          \"raw_text\": \"17. Concomitant administration of any drug that could affect bleeding (e.g. aspirin, clopidogrel, ticlopidine, warfarin, heparin, low-molecular weight heparin)\"\n                                                                        },\n                                                                        \"right\": {\n                                                                          \"OR\": {\n                                                                            \"left\": {\n                                                                              \"raw_text\": \"18. Concomitant administration of oral contraceptives (may be included with 7-day washout period)\"\n                                                                            },\n                                                                            \"right\": {\n                                                                              \"OR\": {\n                                                                                \"left\": {\n                                                                                  \"raw_text\": \"19. Concomitant administration of any herbal medications\"\n                                                                                },\n                                                                                \"right\": {\n                                                                                  \"OR\