testinal obstruction and/or who require drainage gastrostomy tube and/or parenteral hydration or nutrition.\"\n                                                                    },\n                                                                    \"right\": {\n                                                                      \"OR\": {\n                                                                        \"left\": {\n                                                                          \"raw_text\": \"Known immunodeficiency or HIV, Hepatitis B or Hepatitis C positivity.\"\n                                                                        },\n                                                                        \"right\": {\n                                                                          \"OR\": {\n                                                                            \"left\": {\n                                                                              \"raw_text\": \"History of severe allergic reactions to any unknown allergens or components of the study drugs.\"\n                                                                            },\n                                                                            \"right\": {\n                                                                              \"OR\": {\n                                                                                \"left\": {\n                                                                                  \"raw_text\": \"Other serious illnesses (e.g., serious infections requiring antibiotics, bleeding disorders).\"\n                                                                                },\n                                                                                \"right\": {\n                                                                                  \"OR\": {\n                                                           