00 beats per minute)\"\n                                                    },\n                                                    \"right\": {\n                                                      \"AND\": {\n                                                        \"left\": {\n                                                          \"raw_text\": \"Temperature 35-37.9°C (95-100.3°F)\"\n                                                        },\n                                                        \"right\": {\n                                                          \"AND\": {\n                                                            \"left\": {\n                                                              \"raw_text\": \"Systolic blood pressure 90-140 mmHg\"\n                                                            },\n                                                            \"right\": {\n                                                              \"AND\": {\n                                                                \"left\": {\n                                                                  \"raw_text\": \"Diastolic blood pressure 60-90 mmHg\"\n                                                                },\n                                                                \"right\": {\n                                                                  \"AND\": {\n                                                                    \"left\": {\n                                                                      \"raw_text\": \"Heart rate 55-100 beats per minute\"\n                                                                    },\n                                                                    \"right\": {\n                                                                      \"raw_text\": \"Respiration rate 12-18 breaths per minute\"\n                                                                    }\n                      