-like or non-radicular and non-dermatomal distribution in the lower extremities.\"\n                                            },\n                                            \"right\": {\n                                              \"OR\": {\n                                                \"left\": {\n                                                  \"raw_text\": \"Subject has insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus.\"\n                                                },\n                                                \"right\": {\n                                                  \"OR\": {\n                                                    \"left\": {\n                                                      \"raw_text\": \"Subject is morbidly obese (defined as a body mass index >40, or weighs more than 100 lbs over ideal body weight).\"\n                                                    },\n                                                    \"right\": {\n                                                      \"OR\": {\n                                                        \"left\": {\n                                                          \"raw_text\": \"Subject has been diagnosed with active hepatitis, AIDS, or HIV.\"\n                                                        },\n                                                        \"right\": {\n                                                          \"OR\": {\n                                                            \"left\": {\n                                                              \"raw_text\": \"Subject has been diagnosed with rheumatoid arthritis or other autoimmune disease.\"\n                                                            },\n                                                            \"right\": {\n                                                              \"OR\": {\n                                                                \"left\": {\n                           